From 5c3a88fa746dd56dd94c5887fd2669896dcc2da9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: du448 <du44ko@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:03:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add /admin price panel backed by Vercel Blob

The shop can now change a product's price, sale (old) price and stock flag
itself at /admin. Changes are stored as overrides in a Vercel Blob JSON file;
pages read them through a tagged cache, and saving expires every page that
rendered a price, so the static site updates within a minute.

- lib/priceOverrides: read/write the overrides file, cached under the "prices" tag
- lib/pricedCatalog: catalogue with overrides applied, used by every price page
- app/admin: password login (signed httpOnly cookie, login throttle), editor
  with search, category filter, per-row reset and validation
- proxy and robots: /admin skips language routing and is not indexed
- @vercel/blob added to package.json and both lockfiles

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N2APxsuJwjA2GDR26H5KGE
